    "ClaimIntel rule-based labour model. These are NOT OEM / CCC / Audatex / Mitchell",
    "labour times or rates. They are transparent, configurable defaults chosen so the",
    "engine produces an explainable baseline while no estimating database is connected.",
    "Every number here is intended to be replaced wholesale by insurer-supplied or",
    "OEM-supplied data — see services/labour_providers.py for the provider interface."
