  "action_operations": {
    "_note_replace": "PART_REPLACEMENT already includes removing the damaged part and fitting the new one. REMOVE_REINSTALL is for taking an ADJACENT UNDAMAGED assembly off to reach the work, and is mutually exclusive with replacing that same part — real estimating systems never bill both on one line. It used to sit here, which double-billed teardown on every replaced part (one real claim: 20.9h / Rs 15,800 of pure duplication).",
