    "_note_adas": "ADAS calibration is real, mandatory and safety-critical WHEN THE CAR HAS ADAS — replacing a front bumper, windshield, grille or door mirror moves the camera/radar and the OEM requires recalibration. But it was gated on a bare model-name substring, so EVERY Seltos/Creta/Harrier got a calibration line and a +15% complexity uplift regardless of model year — including pre-facelift cars with no ADAS hardware at all. A 2022 Seltos was billed ~Rs 2,700 to calibrate sensors it does not have. adas_from_year gates on the first model year that shipped ADAS on ANY trim.",
